1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:04,300
Imagine a European enterprise software company

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:07,800
expanding into the Middle East.

3
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,700
The platform has two main applications:

4
00:00:10,700 --> 00:00:11,800
Invoicing

5
00:00:12,700 --> 00:00:14,800
and Procurement.

6
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:21,200
The first business requirement sounded simple:

7
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:26,200
support Arabic in both applications.

8
00:00:29,200 --> 00:00:33,500
So we switched the language and document direction

9
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:37,600
from LTR to RTL.

10
00:00:38,200 --> 00:00:40,000
But suddenly,

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,700
several parts of the UI started breaking.

12
00:00:44,200 --> 00:00:48,000
So why did changing the language and direction

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,800
break the UI?
